   "type": "text",
   "x": 640.65,
   "y": 872.5,
   "width": 238.70000000000002,
   "height": 315.0,
   "text": "LOS 5 ENLACES\n\n(1) shell -> ControlNode\n    gRPC unario\n    rutas, bloques, op_id\n\n(2) shell -> DataNode\n    gRPC streaming\n    bloques de 1 MiB en 1 MiB\n\n(3) ControlNode <-> ControlNode\n    TCP de pysyncobj (Raft)\n\n(4) ControlNode -> DataNode\n    gRPC · DeleteBlock\n\n(5) DataNode -> DataNode\n    gRPC streaming (pipeline)",
   "originalText": "LOS 5 ENLACES\n\n(1) shell -> ControlNode\n    gRPC unario\n    rutas, bloques, op_id\n\n(2) shell -> DataNode\n    gRPC streaming\n    bloques de 1 MiB en 1 MiB\n\n(3) ControlNode <-> ControlNode\n    TCP de pysyncobj (Raft)\n\n(4) ControlNode -> DataNode\n    gRPC · DeleteBlock\n\n(5) DataNode -> DataNode\n    gRPC streaming (pipeline)",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "c90_6415",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
